724
01:03:09,540 --> 01:03:10,700
This is nice, though.

725
01:03:15,840 --> 01:03:17,260
I wanted to go... you know what?

726
01:03:17,340 --> 01:03:18,720
This is probably the best time to fish.

727
01:03:20,280 --> 01:03:22,180
Because it's raining. Right?

728
01:03:24,440 --> 01:03:26,880
I'm gonna go in the... there's a big puddle over here.

729
01:03:28,320 --> 01:03:29,360
