795
01:07:12,400 --> 01:07:14,480
Because I don't want it to be filled up just yet.

796
01:07:14,920 --> 01:07:15,700
Uh, go back.

797
01:07:17,900 --> 01:07:18,680
Throw that away.

798
01:07:23,210 --> 01:07:23,930
Okay, let's see.

799
