801
01:07:33,490 --> 01:07:34,050
Menacing...

802
01:07:35,390 --> 01:07:35,950
Uh...

803
01:07:35,950 --> 01:07:36,230
Spectre...

804
01:07:37,250 --> 01:07:38,050
Spectre boots?

805
01:07:38,630 --> 01:07:39,090
What is this?

806
01:07:40,550 --> 01:07:41,830
The wearer can run super fast.

807
01:07:41,990 --> 01:07:43,290
Allows flight? Okay.

808
01:07:44,410 --> 01:07:45,490
Same as that one.

809
01:07:47,850 --> 01:07:48,410
Requires...

810
01:07:48,410 --> 01:07:48,690
