812
01:07:52,250 --> 01:07:54,450
Increases jump speed and allows auto-jump.

813
01:07:55,510 --> 01:07:56,970
The fuck is auto-jump?

814
01:08:00,540 --> 01:08:01,620
So, here's the thing.

815
01:08:02,320 --> 01:08:03,940
Tinkera's Workshop, I can actually

816
01:08:03,940 --> 01:08:05,240
