825
01:08:33,980 --> 01:08:34,380
Uh...

826
01:08:34,380 --> 01:08:35,700
Let's put that there, I guess.

827
01:08:37,420 --> 01:08:38,640
There it is!

828
01:08:39,960 --> 01:08:41,400
